msgstr "Organisation answering for an immovable"

#. module: bf_property_sms
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_sms.view_property_organisation_form_sms
msgid ""
"Ouvrir le canal ne suffit pas : chaque personne doit avoir\n"
"                        consenti de son côté, et le module n'enverra rien à qui ne\n"
"                        l'a pas fait.\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                        Ce que le fournisseur de texto conserve de son côté, et ce\n"
"                        que garde l'appareil du destinataire, ne suit pas la purge du\n"
"                        journal des colis et des visiteurs."
msgstr ""
"Opening the channel is not enough: each person must have\n"
"                        consented on their side, and the module will send nothing to\n"
"                        anyone who has not.\n"
"                        <br/>\n"
"                        What the text-message provider keeps on its side, and what\n"
"                        the recipient's device keeps, does not follow the purge of the\n"
"                        parcel and visitor log."

#. module: bf_property_sms
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_property_sms.field_bf_property_sms_consent__partner_id
