msgstr "Notify this person when a parcel arrives in their name."

#. module: bf_property_sms
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_sms/models/bf_property_announcement.py:0
msgid ""
"Publiez l'annonce avant de l'envoyer par texto : le portail doit pouvoir la "
"relire."
msgstr ""
"Publish the announcement before sending it by text message: the portal must "
"be able to show it again."

#. module: bf_property_sms
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_sms.view_property_sms_consent_form
msgid "Retirer le consentement"
msgstr "Withdraw the consent"

#. module: bf_property_sms
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_property_sms.field_bf_property_sms_consent__withdrawn_date
msgid "Retiré le"
msgstr "Withdrawn on"

#. module: bf_property_sms
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_property_sms.field_bf_property_sms_consent__company_id
msgid "Société"
msgstr "Company"

#. module: bf_property_sms
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:bf_property_sms.field_bf_property_sms_consent__organisation_id
msgid "Syndicat"
msgstr "Syndicate"

#. module: bf_property_sms
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_sms/models/bf_property_sms_consent.py:0
msgid "Un consentement ne se retire pas avant d'être donné."
msgstr "A consent is not withdrawn before it is given."

#. module: bf_property_sms
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_sms.view_property_sms_consent_form
msgid ""
"Un numéro de téléphone n'est pas au registre de droit.\n"
"                            L'article 1070 alinéa 1 du Code civil y met le nom et\n"
"                            l'adresse de chaque copropriétaire et de chaque occupant,\n"
"                            et n'y met les autres renseignements personnels que si la\n"
"                            personne y consent expressément. Cette fiche est ce\n"
"                            consentement, et aucun texto ne part sans elle."
msgstr ""
"A telephone number is not in the register as of right.\n"
"                            Article 1070 paragraph 1 of the Civil Code puts there the name\n"
"                            and address of each co-owner and of each occupant,\n"
"                            and puts other personal information there only if the\n"
"                            person expressly consents. This record is that\n"
"                            consent, and no text message goes out without it."

#. module: bf_property_sms
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_property_sms.field_bf_property_sms_consent__withdrawn_date
msgid ""
"Un retrait n'efface pas la ligne : il la ferme. Effacer empêcherait de dire "
"ce qui était permis au moment d'un envoi déjà fait."
msgstr ""
"A withdrawal does not erase the line: it closes it. Erasing would make it "
"impossible to say what was permitted at the time of a sending already made."

#. module: bf_property_sms
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_sms.view_property_announcement_form_sms
msgid ""
"Un texto part à chaque personne que cette annonce vise et qui a consenti. "
"C'est irréversible."
msgstr ""
"A text message goes to every person this announcement targets who has "
"consented. It cannot be undone."

#. module: bf_property_sms
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_sms/models/bf_property_organisation.py:0
msgid "aucune ligne d'envoi n'est choisie sur la fiche du syndicat"
msgstr "no sending line is chosen on the syndicate's record"

#. module: bf_property_sms
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_sms/models/bf_property_organisation.py:0
msgid "le canal texto du syndicat est fermé"
msgstr "the syndicate's text-message channel is closed"

#. module: bf_property_sms
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_sms/models/bf_property_announcement.py:0
msgid "« %s » a déjà été envoyée par texto le %s."
msgstr "\"%s\" was already sent by text message on %s."

#. module: bf_property_sms
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_property_sms.field_bf_property_organisation__sms_enabled
msgid ""
"⚠️ À l'arrêt par défaut. L'ouvrir ne suffit pas : chaque personne doit avoir"
" consenti de son côté (art. 1070 al. 1 C.c.Q.)."
msgstr ""
"⚠️ Off by default. Turning it on is not enough: each person must have "
"consented on their side (art. 1070 para. 1 CCQ)."
